* SPICE Netlist

*** Voltage Sources ***
V_in 6 0 DC 0
V_AGC 7 0 DC 0
V_CC 2 0 DC 0
V_EE 3 0 DC 0

*** Resistors ***
R5 6 5 VALUE
R1 5 2 VALUE
R6 5 3 VALUE
R3 7 3 VALUE
R4 3 0 VALUE
R2 2 4 VALUE

*** NMOS Transistor ***
M1 4 5 3 3 MODEL_NAME

*** Op-Amp ***
* Use a sub-circuit model for the Op-Amp or ideal element depending on application